#text("\nSources checked. Earlier rounds53-54 supply the explicit mixed kernels, trace and pole-free shift. Andrew Sutherland, MIT18.783 Lecture5 (2025), slides14-16, supplies the standard division-polynomial recurrences: https://math.mit.edu/classes/18.783/2025/LectureSlides5.pdf . Cheon's author PDF, https://www.math.snu.ac.kr/~jhcheon/publications/2010/StrongDH_JoC_Final2.pdf , timed out; the PKC2012 archive PDF https://www.iacr.org/archive/pkc2012/72930594/72930594.pdf returned403. Therefore the implemented two-stage search is justified by the explicit derivation above and exact controls, not a newly verified reading of those full texts. Sources checked (KB): KB unavailable in this runtime; no research-kb MCP tools are loaded and scripts/research-kb is absent in the migrated checkout. No absence or priority claim follows from this gap. [pcc:unverified]\n")
